From 20b457a008486a6944c0f185889bba2e96dbb035 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: davmels <davmelous@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 07:23:12 +0900
Subject: [PATCH] Rubric judges: several judge models in one run

env.extra_judge_pools starts more judge pools next to env.judge_pool, each on nodes of its own and
filling in the Gym model server it names. data.train.gym_agent_choices draws one Gym agent for each
prompt when it is read, so all rollouts of a prompt go to one judge and no score is averaged across
judges. The draw has a generator of its own, so the seeded global one stays as it was.
